@startuml C1_VVE_Execution_Logical
title C1 – VVE Execution (Logical Relationships)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
}

rectangle "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "VveOperationsComponent" as Ui
rectangle "TodoApi VveOperationsController" as Proxy
rectangle "OEM Vve Operations API" as OemApi
rectangle "Planned Operations Repository" as PlannedRepo
rectangle "Executed Operations Repository" as ExecutedRepo
rectangle "Operation Plan Sync Service" as PlanSync
rectangle "IAM" as Iam

Operator --> Ui : Confirm/adjust executions
Ui --> Proxy : PATCH /vves/{id}/operations
Proxy --> Iam : Validate token
Proxy --> OemApi : Forward update JSON
OemApi --> PlannedRepo : Load planned operation details
OemApi --> ExecutedRepo : Persist execution updates
OemApi --> PlanSync : Propagate status to plan
PlanSync --> PlannedRepo : Update status flags
OemApi --> Proxy : Updated operations + warnings
Proxy --> Ui : JSON DTOs
Ui --> Operator : Updated progress + variance

@enduml
